# Admin panel (bootloader — spec in `docs/modules/admin-panel.md` and `docs/modules/admin-questions.md`)

`app/admin.py` is ~7.3k lines: grep `@admin_bp.route('<path>'` for the function you need; never read it whole. Routes keyed by `question_id` must check the question's subject explicitly (`_require_md_admin` pattern) — the subject decorators pass through without a `subject_id`.

## Panel invariants
- `Subject.id` is immutable; only `name` is editable. Delete is 400 while any question references it; cleanup order SavedQuestionSet → SavedFilter (JSON `subject` scan) → UserSubjectPermission → Subject (topics/chapters cascade). Disk is untouched.
- Users: `validate_username` (`^[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,80}$`, reserved names); rename moves `User/<old>` → `User/<new>` best-effort; cannot edit/delete yourself. Permissions payload `{"permissions": {sid: role|''|null}}` merges per key.
- Health: `/admin/health/sync?mode=dry_run|delete` (dry run default; 24 h grace for asset-less questions); `/health/stats` is DB-only. Anomaly hand-off to lists via `?qids=` or `?qids_token=<localStorage key>` (consumed once).
- `/admin/ingestion` is a 302 to `/admin/import`; `admin_ingestion.html` no longer exists.
- Super-admin-only pages: Users, Subjects, Settings, LLM Endpoints, Prompts, Health, `/admin/files`.

## Question Management invariants
- Canonical asset path = `_build_asset_file_path`; IMG is multi-part, MD/DOC single-slot (upload rejects a second one; reorder ignores MD/DOC). Asset delete is `POST|DELETE .../assets/<asset_id>/delete`.
- Every IMG/DOC row mutation calls the `doc_thumbnails.on_*` hooks **after commit**; every MD write calls `md_render.invalidate`.
- List filters `qids` > `selected_ids` > `qid_search` are exclusive; `verified` and `check_status` (+ `check_versions/atypes/formats`, default `TYPED_VERSIONS`) combine. `asset_count` is never subject-scoped.
- Shared Edit modal: `openEditModal(id, {preserveView, preserveAssetScroll})`; hosts define `window.oqbAfterQuestionEdit` and `window.oqbEditNavSource()`; include `edit_question_modal_js.html` only (it pulls `tag_editor_js.html` and `md_editor.html`). Add-question wizard borrows the tag form (`borrowTagFormForAdd` / `returnTagFormToEditModal`).
- localStorage: `oqb_adminQuestionsFilters`, `oqb_selectedQuestions`, `oqb_assetThumbsCompact`; `BULK_DELETE_TYPED_THRESHOLD = 10`.
- QID rename renames files only when `confirm_rename_files` is true.
- Batch ops intersect `question_ids` with `get_user_admin_subjects()`. Generate IMG: `find_best_source` DOC > MD, whole-slot `replace_img_assets`, one `word_session` per run, defaults `BATCH_IMG_DEFAULT_WIDTH/STITCH`, accepts `symmetric_horizontal`. Set MCQ ANS: `q_type='MC'`, answer A–D, PNGs from `resources/mcq_answer_img/`, default `versions=EN`. `batch-set-check-state` skips checked slots unless `overwrite`. Batch update (incl. chapters) UI lives in the **dashboard** Bulk Edit modal.
- `verified` is a whole-question manual flag independent of per-asset `check_state`; UI soft-warns only.

## Gotchas
- SSE routes gather rows in request context, stream under `app.app_context()`.
- DOC thumbnails are keyed by `asset_id`; changing width needs Health → Force Re-render.
